Z||000003||CoolBlue87GT||11-22-2001||07:40 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Brian87egotrip:<BR><B>...I hate tailgaters.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I use to own an 85 Jetta diesel. When driven normal, you couldn't tell it was a diesel.<P>But tailgate me, I'd nail the 'gas' pedal, and low & behold after the dark cloud disapated, I'd no longer be tailgated.<P>Worked like a champ !  It was funny to see the tailgaters reaction each time.<P>||||reg||6
